  "description": "ClosedXML (MIT) based cross-platform Excel (.xlsx) read/write for FrostNova. Runs on net8.0 without System.Drawing.Common or a -windows TFM. Images, shapes and charts are not supported. A drop-in replacement for FrostNova.Core.ExcelWork.Npoi sharing the same public API surface, with no commercial-use restriction (unlike EPPlus or NPOI's image stack).",
